<title>CANADA: Placer Dome Inc Q4 turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Placer Dome Inc Q4 turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(All figures in thousands except per share numbers)</p>
<p>					  4th quarter</p>
<p>				1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr  loss		US$0.24   profit     US$0.16</p>
<p> Net  loss		 57,000   profit	38,000</p>
<p> Revs		     312,000		  294,000</p>
<p>					   12 months</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	US$0.27   profit     US$0.31</p>
<p> Net	  loss	 65,000   profit	74,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,157,000		1,029,000</p>
<p>Note: 1996 year loss includes after-tax charge of US$121 million comprised of US$43 million for impact of accident at Marcopper mine in Philippines and US$78 million for asset disposals and revaluations. Writedowns on mining interests were taken in fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Average shares outstanding rose to 239.5 million at end of 1996 from 238.8 million in the year-earlier period.</p>
</text>
